 "description": "Turn 14, our last two prizes on the table. Step 154 is the MAIN menu on which the agent plays Boss's Orders: the winning-gust detector sees that their benched Fezandipiti ex (210 HP, 2 prizes) dies to Myriad Leaf Shower once the active Ogerpon ex's own Teal Dance attaches the Grass in hand (4 -> 6 effective energy, 30 + 30 x 6 = 210), scores the Boss's as `winning_gust` 20000 and on that promise VETOES the Xerosic's Machinations that caps Powerful Hand. Step 155 is where the promise was broken: the gust TARGET scorer read the same active WITHOUT the ability, saw 150 damage on a 210 HP body, found no KO and gusted the Abra instead -- one prize, and neither the game nor the cap. Step 156 is the MAIN menu after the recorded (wrong) gust; the tests rebuild the post-gust board from it.",
